{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of The Deep Creep, where breathtaking gunfights await you at every corner! Immerse yourself in this dynamic game filled with adrenaline and drive. A variety of weapons and enemies will not let you get bored for a second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to clear the dungeon from the undead, which you unexpectedly got into. Unique retro graphics creates an atmosphere of tension and immerses you in a world where every step can be your last. You can go straight ahead, destroying everything on your way, or act carefully, gradually dismantling your opponents. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to accept the challenge and become a hero who will save the world from sinister forces? Then go ahead, into the heart of The Deep Creep! Let your weapons never fall silent and adrenaline rush through your veins. Good luck, fearless warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 3 different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A variety of weapons and enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized retro graphics </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568380?t=1742568799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568380?t=1742568799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568380/69ec1ad4ba44ffe821bac0f7b96547498a9568c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742568799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568380/69ec1ad4ba44ffe821bac0f7b96547498a9568c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742568799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of The Deep Creep, where breathtaking gunfights await you at every corner! Immerse yourself in this dynamic game filled with adrenaline and drive. A variety of weapons and enemies will not let you get bored for a second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to clear the dungeon from the undead, which you unexpectedly got into. Unique retro graphics creates an atmosphere of tension and immerses you in a world where every step can be your last. You can go straight ahead, destroying everything on your way, or act carefully, gradually dismantling your opponents. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to accept the challenge and become a hero who will save the world from sinister forces? Then go ahead, into the heart of The Deep Creep! Let your weapons never fall silent and adrenaline rush through your veins. Good luck, fearless warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 3 different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A variety of weapons and enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized retro graphics </p>","developers":["WUT Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568380/c020f999b87db218d77c397c9624ea2f353e812b/header.jpg?t=1742568799","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112166,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112166/movie480.mp4?t=1741802932","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112166/movie_max.mp4?t=1741802932"},"name":"tdc trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112166/84b419591c16b8af1dcaadb93d4ff247e51a36d2/movie